 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Topological invariance of the small etale topos",
 "statement": "Let $u:X_0\\to X$ be a universal homeomorphism. Pullback along $u$ is an\nequivalence between the small etale topos of $X$ and that of $X_0$, and for\nevery abelian sheaf $F$ on $X_{\\mathrm{et}}$ and every $n$ it induces an\nisomorphism\n\n$$\nH^n(X_{\\mathrm{et}},F)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}H^n(X_{0,\\mathrm{et}},u^{-1}F).\n$$\n\nThis is Tag `03SI`.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-proper-base-change/sk-thm-p1/prop-weil-pbc-universal-homeomorphism-topos.md",
  "place": "node prop-weil-pbc-universal-homeomorphism-topos, order 1167",
  "external": [
